The cells is a list of 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, and 0.
The last is 3.
The side is 4.
The perimeter is 0.
For every row from 0 to last.
For every column from 0 to last.
The spot is row times side plus column.
If item spot of cells is 1.
Add 4 to perimeter.
If row is more than 0 and item (spot minus side) of cells is 1, subtract 1 from perimeter.
If row is less than last and item (spot plus side) of cells is 1, subtract 1 from perimeter.
If column is more than 0 and item (spot minus 1) of cells is 1, subtract 1 from perimeter.
If column is less than last and item (spot plus 1) of cells is 1, subtract 1 from perimeter.

